    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Beyonder</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Beyonder</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Потусторонний</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Social Reward Claiming Rules: </>\nWhen clearing a dungeon, if the team meets any of the following conditions, the corresponding members can obtain social rewards: \nWhen there are 3 or more players from the same Family in the team, the team members of that Family can obtain rewards. \nWhen there are 3 or more players from the same Club in the team, the team members of that Club can obtain rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward count consumption rules: </>\nSocial reward counts are only consumed when the claim conditions are met and the dungeon is cleared."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Правила получения социальных наград: </>\nПри прохождении подземелья, если команда соответствует любому из следующих условий, соответствующие члены могут получить социальные награды: \nКогда в команде 3 или более игроков из одной семьи, члены команды этой семьи могут получить награды. \nКогда в команде 3 и более игроков из одного Клуба, члены команды этого Клуба могут получить награды. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Правила использования счетчика наград: </>\nСчетчики социальных наград расходуются только тогда, когда условия заявки выполнены и подземелье очищено.",
